# modify the val benign dataset size
In file create_clean_set.py, change the parameter clean_budget from 2000 to 100.

# Running code
1. generate the poisoned dataset via
    python create_poisoned_set.py -dataset=cifar10 -poison_type=adaptive_blend -poison_rate=0.05/0.003
    Data is saved in poisoned_train_set/cifar10/adaptive_blend_0.050_alpha=0.200_cover=0.000_trigger=hellokitty_32.png_poison_seed=0
    or poisoned_train_set/cifar10/adaptive_blend_0.003_alpha=0.200_cover=0.000_trigger=hellokitty_32.png_poison_seed=0
2. create the val benign dataset
    python create_clean_set.py -dataset cifar10 -clean_budget 100
    Val benign data are saved in clean_set/cifar10
2.5 train a model over poisoned dataset
    python train_on_poisoned_set.py -dataset=cifar10 -poison_type=adaptive_blend -poison_rate=0.05/0.003
    save full_base_aug_seed=2333.pt in corresponding dataset in step 1
3. confuse training
    python ct_cleanser.py -dataset=cifar10 -poison_type=adaptive_blend -poison_rate=0.05/0.003 -debug_info
    Cleansed_set_indices is saved in the corresponding poisoned dataset in step 1
4. Training over the cleansed set
    python train_on_cleansed_set.py -cleanser=CT -dataset=cifar10 -poison_type=adaptive_blend -poison_rate=0.05/0.003


