# Running code for ultrasonic
1. generate the poisoned dataset
    The poisoned dataset is generated by DefTimeSeries project and saved in /storageA/david_projects/DefTimeSeries/poisonDataset/ultrasonic
2. create the val benign dataset
    Manually select 100 samples from training dataset saved in /storageA/david_projects/DefTimeSeries/poisonDataset/ultrasonic/valTrain
2.5 train a model over poisoned dataset
    python train_on_poisoned_set.py -dataset=ultrasonic -poison_rate=0.05/0.003
    save full_base_aug_seed=2333.pt in /storageA/david_projects/Fight-Poison-With-Poison-master/poisoned_train_set/ultrasonic/none_0.003_poison_seed=0
    or /storageA/david_projects/Fight-Poison-With-Poison-master/poisoned_train_set/ultrasonic/none_0.05_poison_seed=0
3. confuse training
    python ct_cleanser.py -dataset=ultrasonic -poison_rate=0.05 -debug_info
4. Training over the cleansed set
    python train_on_cleansed_set.py -cleanser=CT -dataset=ultrasonic -poison_rate=0.05/0.003



